#. :src: bpy.types.ANIM_OT_merge_animation
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Merge Animation"
msgstr "Sammanfoga animation"

#. :src: bpy.types.ANIM_OT_merge_animation
msgid "Merge the animation of the selected objects into the action of the active object. Actions are not deleted by this, but might end up with zero users"
msgstr ""
"Slå ihop animeringen av de valda objekten med det aktiva objektets åtgärd. "
"Åtgärder raderas inte av detta, men kan sluta med noll användare"

#. :src: bpy.types.ANIM_OT_paste_driver_button
#: source/blender/editors/interface/interface_context_menu.cc:792
